# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale ru
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as вечер [18:00, 24:00).
# Surface: the instrumental adverb "вечером" ("in the evening"), the form these
# deictic phrases use ("сегодня вечером", "вчера вечером").
# Source: Wiktionary, "вечером" (adverb, instrumental of вечер)
# https://ru.wiktionary.org/wiki/вечером
вечером
